title: Data sent to a Discord webhook
severity: high
score: 65
tags: phishing, exfil
attack: T1567, T1102.002
description: The page posted to a Discord webhook (discord.com/api/webhooks/...) from the
  browser: webhooks are a server-side drop, not something a normal web page uses.
---
requests
| where host in (list("exfiltration.discord_hosts"))
    and begins_with_match(path, list("exfiltration.discord_webhook"))
| project method, host, has_body = isnotempty(post)
